=== Prompt for SKY-001-A (attempt 1) ===
Implement user story SKY-001-A: Scaffold TypeScript/Express project file structure and configuration

## Story Description
Create all required files and install dependencies for the skyscanner-app project at /tmp/skyscanner-app. This story covers file creation and content correctness only; runtime verification is covered in SKY-001-B.

## Acceptance Criteria
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/package.json exists with name='skyscanner-app', scripts (build, test, start, dev), dependencies (express), and devDependencies (typescript, tsx, vitest, @types/express, @types/node)
- package.json 'scripts.test' equals 'vitest run'
- package.json 'scripts.start' equals 'node dist/server.js'
- package.json 'scripts.build' invokes tsc (e.g. 'tsc' or 'tsc -p tsconfig.json')
- package.json 'scripts.dev' invokes tsx against src/index.ts
- package.json contains no dependency whose name includes 'skyscanner' or any Skyscanner/RapidAPI SDK
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/tsconfig.json exists with compilerOptions: strict=true, target='ES2022', module='CommonJS', moduleResolution='Node', outDir='dist/'
- tsconfig.json does not enable allowJs (omitted or set to false)
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/vitest.config.ts exists, imports defineConfig from 'vitest/config', exports a default config, sets test.globals=true, test.environment='node', and test.include=['src/**/*.test.ts']
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/.gitignore exists containing 'node_modules' and 'dist' entries, and contains no hardcoded secrets
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/src/index.ts exists as a valid TypeScript placeholder file
- /tmp/skyscanner-app/node_modules/ directory exists confirming npm install succeeded
- No configuration file contains hardcoded API keys, tokens, or passwords

## Technical Notes
- workingDir: /tmp/skyscanner-app
- files: ["/tmp/skyscanner-app/package.json","/tmp/skyscanner-app/tsconfig.json","/tmp/skyscanner-app/vitest.config.ts"]
- notes: CRITICAL — vitest.config.ts MUST include the pattern: include: ['src/**/*.test.ts']. Without this vitest picks up compiled dist/**/*.test.js files and fails with "Vitest cannot be imported in a CommonJS module". The correct vitest.config.ts:
  import { defineConfig } from 'vitest/config';
  export default defineConfig({ test: { globals: true, environment: 'node', include: ['src/**/*.test.ts'] } });

CRITICAL — package.json MUST have a 'test' script. External verification runs 'npm test' and fails with exit 1 if the script is missing. Required scripts section:
  "scripts": { "start": "node dist/server.js", "build": "tsup", "test": "vitest run" }

## Files to Create/Modify
/tmp/skyscanner-app/package.json, /tmp/skyscanner-app/tsconfig.json, /tmp/skyscanner-app/vitest.config.ts

## Dependencies
None

